// SaysList :
"P3742332706" "<t=2 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray> Hello?<t=1 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=1><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>Can you hear me?<t=2 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor SlateGray>Little trouble...<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.5 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>There we go. {HeroName}, right? I'm BV. Heard about you.<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>You were asking about Eddie Polstra. Bad news. We don't know much about him.<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>All we know is that he's one of Cole's new dogs, maybe more powerful than all of them.<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>We need more information on him, if you can get it...<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>We've talked for too long, you need to run, now! Ghouls will be attacking you at any moment!"

