// Objective - FindDatabaseComputer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3939031530" "File Cabinet"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3332007750" "You flip through the file cabinet..."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1838763339" "You retrieved Eddie's files, now to get out of here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3832558140" "You found Eddie's Files!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2431559616" "You've got the files, now to get out of here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1274895646" "Breaking into the Ministry isn't easy, {HeroName}.<br><br>We were only able to get this far 'cause of a guy named <color yellow>Paolo Marino</color>.<br><br>He's an insider we have in the PPD. You can thank him for holding off the patrols of Loyalists as long as he could.<br><br>That info you found sure is weird, though. Looks like this Eddie guy isn't from Old San Jose. But where could he be from that the Loyalists don't want us knowing?<br><br>This sure makes me wonder, but we can worry about a question and answer session later. We need to get this info into the right hands."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3570729137" "{HeroName}, good to meet you in person. I apologize it had to be done in this manner, but, well, when you live like I do, you can't take any chances. My name is BV - <color yellow>Belladona Vetrano</color>.<br><br>You have the dossier on Eddie Polstra, yes?"
// Answer Text :
"P2313205020" "That I do. What are you going to do with it?"
// Answer Text :
"P1221810849" "(Plant tracking device on the folder and hand it over)"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1036976539" "This may come as a surprise, but I'm simply delivering this to someone else who might know what to do with it.<br><br>The man's name is <color yellow>Dark Watcher</color>, though I haven't met him in person. Very mysterious, that one. I received a message after your discovery of Eddie Polstra. It was from Dark Watcher, saying to do everything possible to find out what they know about Eddie.<br><br>I'm not too sure who this Dark Watcher is, but he's extremely interested in Eddie."
// Answer Text :
"P3980327458" "Well, here is the file. What's next?"
// Page InformationPage1A Text :
"P163942737" "<color orange>You hand Belladonna the folder with a small tracking device on it.</color><br><br>This may come as a surprise, but I'm simply delivering this to someone else who might know what to do with it.<br><br>The man's name is <color yellow>Dark Watcher</color>, though I haven't met him in person. Very mysterious, that one. I received a message after your discovery of Eddie Polstra. It was from Dark Watcher, saying to do everything possible to find out what they know about Eddie.<br><br>I'm not too sure who this Dark Watcher is, but he's extremely interested in Eddie."
// Answer Text :
"P3523049410" "What's next?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P148657537" "That would be it, I believe.<br><br>I'll bring this to Dark Watcher's <i>other</i> messenger, it should get to him eventually."
// Answer Text :
"P70486005" "Alright, I'm going to be on my way."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P333430945" "...?! Hold on, {HeroName}! We've got a situation!"
// Answer Text :
"P651474156" "PPD!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Marchand 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2687529728" "{HeroName}?<br><br>What can I do for you?"
// Answer Text :
"P3264424638" "I've infiltrated the Resistance. I have information you might want to hear."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P4047761117" "You've infiltrated the Resistance?<br><br>That's perfect. Praetor White told me that he mentioned such plans to members of the Powers Division. What have you found?"
// Answer Text :
"P236268990" ""(Mention what has happened, including your conversation with 'BV')"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P4063975950" "Hrm... so they know about Eddie Polstra?<br><br>Interesting. BV... BV...<br><br>...!<br><br>{HeroName}! You said you were going to meet her?"
// Answer Text :
"P1105880507" "Yes. Do you know who she is?"
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P566465746" "Yes. BV is <color yellow>Belladona Vetrano</color>. She was one of Praetor Sinclair's assassins. We believed she was dead... but now it seems that she has sided with the Resistance.<br><br>This is very troubling, to be sure."
// Answer Text :
"P3513664637" "I can kill her, no problem."
// Answer Text :
"P2992367534" "What should be done about her?"
// Page Killher Text :
"P598013440" "No! Absolutely not.<br><br>Praetor Sinclair harbors a very... deep hatred of the woman. If you were to steal his vengeance, I imagine we'd have all of his operatives running loose in the city.<br><br>No... instead, I think we should track her.<br><br>You're delivering her the information on Eddie, correct? You can place a small tracking device on the piece of paper.<br><br>We'll just need to know her location long enough to find out where she brought the folder to - then I'll remotely detonate it from my end.<br><br>It's good to be working together, {HeroName}, I can see this going places."
// Answer Text :
"P730924375" "I can too. I'll speak with you soon."
// Answer Text :
"P1564103108" "Who is Eddie Polstra?"
// Page Whatshouldbe Text :
"P1757081581" "I think our best option would be to track her.<br><br>You're delivering her the information on Eddie, correct? You can place a small tracking device on the piece of paper.<br><br>We'll just need it long enough to find out where she brought the folder to - then I'll remotely detonate it from my end.<br><br>It's good to be working together, {HeroName}, I can see this going places."
// Page Speakwithyousoon Text :
"P2731356789" "I'm sure you will, {HeroName}. Good luck."
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page EddiePolstra Text :
"P2706132961" "I wish I could tell you, {HeroName}. Cole is playing Eddie's involvement in the regime close to his chest.<br><br>I've heard rumors from the Praetors that Eddie is from somewhere that Cole wishes to keep secret.<br><br>If I hear any more, I'll let you know. I believe you and I are fast on our way to having a very lucrative partnership in bringing down the Resistance."
// Answer Text :
"P217130158" "Very well, I'll speak to you again soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P81534694" "I got word from some members of the Resistance that we need to get this information on Eddie to that woman you talked to, <color yellow>BV</color>. Which... will be tough. See, BV is kinda wanted for... a lot of things. So any meetings with her need to be strictly in the underground.<br><br>She's arranged a place for this meeting to happen. Fortunately, <i>you</i> get to be the one to meet her. I mean, you know how badly I want to meet her face to face? If I just had a chance... I mean, what could she look like? Do you think she's beautiful?<br><br>... anyway. <i>Unfortunately</i>, the meeting is happening in a part of the tunnels infested by ghouls. It's the one place that she knows the PPD won't be - we can't risk her getting captured. So, are you up for a playdate with BV in a hive of ghouls?"
// AcceptString :
"P1612410759" "Well, Robert, you make it sound terribly enticing."
// SendOffString :
"P3589191344" "I know, right?<br><br>You can get to the tunnels that she'll be in through the usual entrance.<br><br><color orange>You'll have to clear out some ghouls first before it'll be safe for her to come out.</color><br><br>She's tough, but, well, we also can't risk her getting chomped by some ghouls. Precious cargo, you know?<br><br><color yellow>Players who <i>originally</i> chose Loyalist now have the opportunity to call up Provost Marchand to inform him of current events. Messages such as this will appear in missions where this is possible. If you originally did not choose to be a Loyalist, you can not do undercover Loyalist work in Resistance missions; you <i>can</i> do undercover work against the Loyalists in their missions. Players who change their faction can still do undercover work for the side they originally chose."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2161515782" "Meet with BV"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3800482894" "Man, can you at least tell her that I said hello?"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P692076288" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: Face to Face</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2004294065" "The stench of ghouls and death hangs in the air.<br><br>This seems to be exactly the kind of place BV prefers to meet with people."

